{"unit_id":"hjhcos__dsh-plugin-discovery#card-zh","repo":"hjhcos/dsh-plugin-discovery","commit":"3aca3ff02b8ddb59fd0fe7524991e35a99b961fb","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-discovery 是面向 DSH Web 的社区插件发现工具，在侧栏提供精选推荐、分类浏览和在线搜索界面。它通过 DSH Bundle 服务加载本地目录，并可刷新远程目录；用户可以按已安装插件获得个性化排序，也可以搜索 npm 与 GitHub、解析已知链接。候选可经 Bundle 检查后安装，界面显示安装状态并支持恢复等待中的安装任务。适合希望从 DSH 内浏览和管理社区插件的用户。可选配置 GitHub Token 提高 GitHub 搜索配额；目录刷新和版本检查访问 Gitee、GitHub 与 npm。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1927-1949","index.js:844-893","index.js:895-1003","index.js:1062-1145"]}
{"unit_id":"hjhcos__dsh-plugin-discovery#card-en","repo":"hjhcos/dsh-plugin-discovery","commit":"3aca3ff02b8ddb59fd0fe7524991e35a99b961fb","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-discovery adds a DSH web sidebar for community plugin recommendations, categories, and search. It ranks by installed plugins, searches npm/GitHub, resolves links, checks bundles, installs them, and tracks status. GitHub token is optional; catalog refresh uses Gitee/GitHub.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1927-1949","index.js:844-893","index.js:895-1003","index.js:1062-1145"]}
