{"unit_id":"hjhcos__dsh-plugin-discovery#caveat-1","repo":"hjhcos/dsh-plugin-discovery","commit":"3aca3ff02b8ddb59fd0fe7524991e35a99b961fb","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-discovery 在线搜索时会向 npm Registry 或 GitHub API 发送搜索关键词；GitHub Token 是可选配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:372-378","index.js:403-413","index.js:460"]}
{"unit_id":"hjhcos__dsh-plugin-discovery#caveat-2","repo":"hjhcos/dsh-plugin-discovery","commit":"3aca3ff02b8ddb59fd0fe7524991e35a99b961fb","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-discovery 会尝试从 Gitee 或 GitHub 获取精选目录并将其缓存到本地；未设置 DSH_HOME 时缓存位于插件目录的 .cache 下。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:124-160","index.js:175-208","index.js:133-136"]}
